        ; - RESOLVE_DRIVE_MAPPING — AL=0FFh and ret on failure.
        ; - RESET_DPB_PROBE_DRIVE (rescan media if needed).
        ; - GET_DPB_BY_DRIVE_INDEX → returns DS:DX = DPB.
        ; - Store DS:DX into caller's saved-BX/saved-DS via `[ES:DI+0Eh]`
        ; and `[ES:DI+2]` in the saved-reg block.
        ;
