DOS_FN_1B_GET_FAT_INFO_DEFAULT:
        ; INT 21h AH=1Bh handler (get fat info default)
        ; Standard MS-DOS AH=1Bh "Get FAT Info, Default Drive". Returns
        ; sectors/cluster (AL), bytes/sector (CX), DS:BX = media-descriptor
        ; byte, and DX = cluster count.
        ;
        ; Body: 2-instruction prefix (`sub dl, dl` makes DL=0 = default drive)
        ; before falling through into AH=1Ch's body.
