        ; - RESOLVE_DRIVE_MAPPING(DL) → may raise error 0Fh (invalid drive).
        ; - INT21_GETDPB_FILL_BUFFER copies sectors/cluster, bytes/sector,
        ; media-byte ptr, cluster count into the caller's saved regs.
